<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth Inc said Wednesday it initiated coverage of Lowe's Cos Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--It said the retailer is more than halfway through its strategic decision to transform the company to a chain of home improvement superstores from a chain of conventionally sized stores.</p>
<p>--Dain Bosworth's per-share earnings estimates for the company are $1.66 for 1996 and $2.01 for 1997. Its 12-month price target on the stock is $52.</p>
<p>--Lowe's was trading at 38-7/8, down 1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
